{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"The network evidence diagram (Figure 4A) depicts that the 10 included studies collectively evaluated a total of 11 distinct stimulation modalities: 60 Hz-STN-DBS, spDBS, 80 Hz-STN-DBS, right STN-DBS, left STN-DBS, IL-IL-DBS, TBS-DBS, STN + SNr LF-DBS, STN + SNr HF-DBS, PPNa-DBS, and STN-DBS. Table 3 presents the results of the network meta-analysis based on a random-effects model. The overall estimates indicate that, compared with the control group, none of the DBS interventions yielded statistically significant improvements in FOG-Q scores.\",\n    \"The results indicate that the 95% CIs for all interventions cross zero, and none of the p-values reached statistical significance (p > 0.05), suggesting that no DBS intervention demonstrated a reliable statistical effect in improving FOG-Q scores; although all SMD values were negative and hinted at slight improvements, the overall strength of evidence remained limited.\",\n    \"Heterogeneity and consistency assessments for the FOG-Q outcome showed high variability, with τ2 = 1.3074 and I2 = 88.3% (95% CI: 72.5–95.0%). The total Q was 25.61 (df = 3, p < 0.0001), indicating significant network inconsistency.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"The overall estimates indicate that, compared with the control group, none of the DBS interventions yielded statistically significant improvements in FOG-Q scores.\",\n    \"The results indicate that the 95% CIs for all interventions cross zero, and none of the p-values reached statistical significance (p > 0.05)\",\n    \"Third, leave-one-out sensitivity analysis was conducted by sequentially omitting each individual study to examine its influence on the overall effect estimate.\",\n    \"Panel B presents the leave-one-out sensitivity analysis with FOG-Q score as the outcome\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"原文明确支持报告对主要分析结果的描述：FOG-Q涉及11种刺激模式，所有模式的主要分析结果均未达到统计学显著性，且95%置信区间均跨零。同时，原文明确报告I²=88.3%，总Q检验p<0.0001，表明存在显著网络不一致性。因此，报告引用主要分析的阴性结果并非误读。另一方面，指控者关于敏感性分析出现相反结果的描述，只能得到部分支持。原文确实进行了逐项剔除（leave-one-out）敏感性分析，并在Figure 7中列出FOG-Q分析，但所提供的全文文本在敏感性分析部分仅有图注，没有报告逐项剔除后的具体p值或置信区间，也没有明确写出所有p值均小于0.05、置信区间均不跨零。因此，无法仅凭所提供的全文确认指控者所称的内部结果矛盾。最终判断：报告对主要分析的转述有明确依据；指控者对主要分析的描述有依据，但对敏感性分析结果的描述缺乏可核实的全文文字依据，不能据此认定报告遗漏了一个已经由全文明确证实的内部矛盾。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1533a037-b536-4408-a09e-339a69da7678", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125549490667Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:57:13.140476+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7ab66b51f5e9cafdff1cc070e64e32d64214149efc961812711aed38e58cc3a4", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125549490667Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "11fecc4153d752936ce9cc3155ea792af205bd64d40916ba4ae14c399288ccbe"}}}
